# delayed_convolution_synapse.nestml
# ###################################
#
#
# Description
# +++++++++++
#
# Test model for convolutions with a delayed presynaptic spike train in a synapse, ``convolve(K, pre_spikes(t - d))``.
#
# Each presynaptic spike at time :math:`t_k` adds an exponentially decaying trace from :math:`t_k + d` onwards. The synapse
# sums the traces seen at each pre- and postsynaptic spike, and integrates them exactly over time in its ``update`` block.
# Because the convolution variables are piecewise exponential only between delayed releases, the integral is only exact if
# the update block is run separately for each interval between releases.
#
#
# Copyright statement
# +++++++++++++++++++
